Z||000008||DaRkLoRD||03-01-2000||05:47 PM||||Monkeyman, Yes, actually.. I have a client right now who would like their page hosted by me, and if I upgrade my Fiero Project server, I'll break even with that plus the hosting money from the 2 fiero sites I have lined up. no profit yet, but at least the site will be paid for!<P>stimpy, that looks awesome!! I'm not sure how a custom engraved plenum would look with similar lettering, but for $7, that'd be great. How did you attach the badge to the plenum?||||reg||1
Z||000009||Monkeyman||03-01-2000||06:33 PM||||Anybody know how thick the plenum is?  How deep could the engraving be without damage?  Is there any pressure inside the plenum I'd need to worry about?||||reg||1
